# "sedmica" is the unambiguous week word this locale ships as a duration
# unit; "nedelja" is deliberately excluded here (see weekday_6.voc) because
# it also names Sunday and the two senses are not locally disambiguable in
# a bare NUM+UNIT phrase.  Full paradigm plus paucal: "dve sedmice" (2-4,
# gen sg), "pet sedmica" (5+, gen pl).  Wiktionary, sedmica, declension
# table -- https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sedmica#Serbo-Croatian
sedmica
седмица
sedmice
седмице
